        "docs": [
          "Verify that every listed vector signed this transaction, and move each to its next nonce.",
          "Every signer signs the same message, the transaction with this instruction's next keys and signatures left out: valid_until stays in, so every signature covers the one expiry. Each key signs \"vector:\" || SHA256(message || nonce || address || next_key), and that digest becomes its next nonce.",
